{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119948","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119948/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119948/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119948/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119948","id":4565622612,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7hfWW4","number":119948,"title":"Add information about easy `rand_weighted()` pitfall","user":{"login":"PodunkGames","id":286503757,"node_id":"U_kgDOEROzTQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/286503757?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PodunkGames","html_url":"https://github.com/PodunkGames","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PodunkGames/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PodunkGames/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PodunkGames/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PodunkGames/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PodunkGames/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PodunkGames/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PodunkGames/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PodunkGames/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PodunkGames/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"aaccff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097162,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTcxNjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/discussion","name":"discussion","color":"ccaaff","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518839,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg4Mzk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/documentation","name":"documentation","color":"ffddff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":7,"created_at":"2026-06-01T19:03:06Z","updated_at":"2026-06-04T20:53:47Z","closed_at":"2026-06-04T20:44:58Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119948","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119948","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119948.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119948.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"This part of the `rand_weighted()` method under the hood causes negative number weights to produce likely-unexpected results.\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\nfor (int64_t i = 0; i < weights_size; ++i) {\r\n\tweights_sum += weights[i];\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nAdded a brief mention of this fact under the `rand_weighted()` method.\r\n\r\nTo reproduce what I'm talking about, this code will only ever print the number 1 because the `-6.0` weight is added to the weights_sum canceling out all other values. \r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\nfunc _ready() -> void:\r\n\tvar my_array: Array[int] = [1, 2, 3, 4]\r\n\tvar my_weights: Array[float] = [1.0, 2.0, 3.0, -6.0]\r\n\tvar rng: RandomNumberGenerator = RandomNumberGenerator.new()\r\n\tfor i: int in 1000:\r\n\t\tprint(my_array[rng.rand_weighted(my_weights)])\r\n\r\n```\r\n\r\nI'm doubtful this is a bug, but it's definitely an easy pitfall.\r\n\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Explains a behavior that isn't currently documented, but easy to run into if you commonly manipulate weights for things like random loot generation with a luck stat.\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nProvide additional information and explanation of your PR, including areas that you are uncertain of or require special attention from reviewers. For examples, please read our pull request guidelines: https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/pull_requests/pull_request_guidelines.html#explain-your-contributions\r\n-->\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"PodunkGames","id":286503757,"node_id":"U_kgDOEROzTQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/286503757?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PodunkGames","html_url":"https://github.com/PodunkGames","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PodunkGames/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PodunkGames/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PodunkGames/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PodunkGames/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PodunkGames/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PodunkGames/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PodunkGames/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PodunkGames/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PodunkGames/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119948/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119948/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}